Review this JavaScript code snippet and suggest improvements for readability and performance:

```js
function processItems(arr) {
  let result = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    if (arr[i] % 2 === 0) result.push(arr[i] * 2);
  }
  return result;
}
```

